                                                "sense_id": "f5e237a0-b44d-3ad3-ac41-53fcf5e399aa",
                                                "text": "Jessamy looked round her in a puzzled way, but there was nothing to see but the pale oblong of what looked like a star-pierced sky behind the bars of the nursery window."
                                            }
